{
	// Config //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	"config.SebSched.name": "SebSched",
	"config.SebSched.description": "When disabled, Sebastian will not visit the frog habitats once a month.",
	"config.SebRainSched.name": "SebRainSched",
	"config.SebRainSched.description": "When disabled, Sebastian will not have a 50% chance of visiting the frog habitats on rainy days.",
	"config.VincentSched.name": "VincentSched",
	"config.VincentSched.description": "When disabled, Vincent will not visit the frog habitats once a month.",
	"config.VincentRainSched.name": "VincentRainSched",
	"config.VincentRainSched.description": "When disabled, Vincent will not have a 50% chance of visiting the frog habitats on rainy days.",
	"config.EditEvents.name": "EditEvents",
	"config.EditEvents.description": "When disabled, Sebastian's vanilla 14-heart event won't be modified to match this mod.",
	"config.DialoguePatches.name": "DialoguePatches",
	"config.DialoguePatches.description": "When disabled, dialogue (including marriage dialogue) added by this mod won't be applied. Does not include conversation topics.",
	"config.Froggy.name": "Froggy",
	"config.Froggy.description": "When disabled, Sebastian will not occasionally call you Froggy as a pet name when married.",
	"config.CrossoverContent.name": "CrossoverContent",
	"config.CrossoverContent.description": "When disabled, crossover content will not occur. Does not include compatibility patches.",
	"config.PlatonicBonusEvent.name": "PlatonicBonusEvent",
	"config.PlatonicBonusEvent.description": "When enabled, you'll be able to view a platonic version of the bonus event added by this mod instead of the romantic version. This option was made to be used together with the Fourteen Heart Events For All mod, but can be used without it.",
	// Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Sebastian
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.AcceptGiftFrogEgg": "...!#$b#@, do you know what this is?#$b#It's an egg for the rare Gourmand Frog.#$b#They're an endangered species!#$b#Thanks for giving this to me, I'm going to take a closer look at it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.AcceptGift_GenFrogEgg1": "Cool, a frog egg!#$b#It's not a Gourmand Frog, but it's still pretty neat.#$b#Thanks @.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.AcceptGift_GenFrogEgg2": "Oh hey!#$b#This is another Gourmand Frog egg!#$b#Thanks @!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogLake": "I can't wait for the frogs to hatch.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogHatch": "Watching the frogs hatch was so cool!$7#$b#I'm glad we were there for it.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogVideo": "I uploaded the frog video.#$b#It's been getting a lot of hits!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogSick": "The frog is doing much better now.#$b#I think I'll be able to release it back into the wild soon.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogSchool": "Vincent's been asking a lot more questions about frogs lately.#$e#I think he misses them because they're hibernating right now.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogIsland": "I saw some good spots for frog habitats near your farm on the island.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogFrog": "I still can't believe the legends are real...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogStay": "Let me know if there's anything I can help you with, @.$7#$b#I owe you a lot.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.SebFrogAdvAbi": "How does one farmer meet so many interesting people?$5",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Mon8": "Hey, how's it going?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Wed8": "I've been getting to know more people in town lately.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Sun8": "When it rains I like to go to either the beach to stare into the horizon, or the lake to listen to the frogs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Thu8": "The guy who lives in a tent near my house let me know about an injured frog he found.$7#$b#It's nice to know someone else is looking out for them too.$7#$e#Maybe I should try talking to him more...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.spring_Mon8": "More frogs have been hatching lately.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.summer_Tue8": "I'm looking forward to the cold, damp season. That's when the frogs really ramp up their croaking.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.summer_Thu8": "Sorry I'm covered in mud, I was working on some new frog habitats.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.fall_Tue8": "Sam, Abigail, and I were out late last night checking on the frogs.#$e#Sam's mom made us spaghetti when we finally got back to town.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.winter_Sat8": "The frogs are all hibernating now.#$b#I can't wait to see them again in spring.||I like winter but I do feel bad for all the cold animals out there.#$e#I guess they're used to it, though... like me.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.winter_Sun8": "Demetrius has been talking about adding me as a contributor to one of his soil research papers.#$b#Does that make me a scientist?$5||I made some snowfrogs around town.#$b#I'm not very good at sculpting though.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Resort_Wander": "Hey @, want to help me check on the island frog habitats?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.fall_Mon8": "The conservation website's been doing really well lately.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Rainy_Night_5": "The frogs must be loving the rain out there.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Neutral_9": "I think I'm going to go spend some time checking on the frogs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.spring_4": "I need to get a new frog population count now that spring's here.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.summer_6": "Happy to see you, but I've gotta go wash all this sweat off.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.fall_9": "Sorry I keep tracking mud into the house. The habitats have been pretty damp lately.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.winter_14": "Since the frogs are hibernating... Wanna cuddle?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.OneKid_4": "%kid1 looks kind of like a frog...#$e#...$5#$e#That's a compliment, I promise!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.TwoKids_4": "The kids sure like hopping around like frogs, don't they?$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Good_9": "I'm so glad to have you in my life.#$e#You make me so happy.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Rainy_Night_5": "The frogs must be loving the rain out there.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Neutral_9": "I think I'm going to go spend some time checking on the frogs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.spring_4": "I need to get a new frog population count now that spring's here.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.summer_6": "Happy to see you Froggy, but I've gotta go wash all this sweat off.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.fall_9": "Sorry I keep tracking mud into the house Froggy. The habitats have been pretty damp lately.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.winter_14": "Since the frogs are hibernating... Wanna cuddle?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.OneKid_4": "%kid1 looks kind of like a frog...#$e#...$5#$e#That's a compliment, I promise!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.TwoKids_4": "The kids sure like hopping around like frogs, don't they?$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Good_9": "I'm so glad to have you in my life, Froggy.#$e#You make me so happy.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Rainy_Day_2": "Hey. I couldn't sleep last night so I took a walk to the caves. I found this... want it?[575 769 767 84 66 78]#$e#I just have trouble sleeping sometimes, it has nothing to do with you. I love you Froggy.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Indoor_Day_1": "Hey Froggy... want some coffee?[395]$7#$e#I needed some... woke up early from a nightmare and I just couldn't fall back asleep.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Indoor_Night_4": "I often felt unappreciated back home... but here I feel like I really belong. Thanks for making me feel welcome, Froggy.$l",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Outdoor_0": "I feel like I want to do something today... but I'm not sure what. Do you ever have that problem, Froggy?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.TwoKids_3": "We've come a long way, Froggy. Look at our family. To be honest, I never really thought I'd end up in this situation.#$e#Now that I'm here, I like it...$l",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.Good_1": "Hey... come here Froggy. You look great today.$l",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Seb.Married.Froggy.winter_28": "It's been a great year, Froggy. We should celebrate a little. [346]$h#$e#I'm sure next year will be even better.$7",
	// Abigail
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Abigail.SebFrogHatch": "Seb mentioned you found a lot of those frog eggs while out adventuring.#$b#Could you give me some tips on finding them?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Abigail.SebFrogIsland": "I've never seen Seb so pumped to take an island vacation.$1#$b#He's very excited to expand the frog project.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Abigail.SebFrogAdvAbi": "The dwarf, the wizard, the giant talking frog...#$e#Any other interesting people you're hiding?$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Abigail.Thu6": "I never realized how much work taking care of some piles of moss and wood could be.#$b#Those habitats are no joke!#$e#At least Sam's mom makes good food for us afterwards.",
	// Sam
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Sam.SebFrogHatch": "I gotta admit, I didn't think asking Seb to babysit Vincent for me would lead to a whole project, but it's kinda cool.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Sam.SebFrogIsland": "Seb didn't seem too interested in visiting the island at first, but now he's practically itching to go back.#$b#I think I'll go with him next time.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Sam.SebFrogAdvAbi": "Hey @, been on any cool adventures lately?#$e#Mind if I tag along on the next one?$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Sam.Tue6": "Me and Abby've been helping Seb with his frog project.#$b#It's a lot of hard work but my mom always makes us hot dinner when we get back, so that's pretty sweet.",
	// Demetrius
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Demetruis.SebFrogSick": "The frog Sebastian brought in is doing much better.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Demetruis.Tue6": "Sebastian and I have been developing a fairly advanced profile of the Valley's soil acidity.#$b#He's becoming quite the researcher.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Demetruis.summer_Tue6": "I wonder if water retaining soil would encourage a higher variety of plant growth around the frog habitats.#$b#I should float the idea to Sebastian.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Demetruis.winter_Tue6": "Sebastian and I are planning to take ice samples of the lake to see what kind of conditions the hibernating frogs are experiencing this winter.#$b#Maru and Robin are building a specialized drill for the expedition.#$b#Isn't it exciting how teamwork furthers the advancement of scientific knowledge?$1",
	// Robin
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Robin.SebFrogHatch": "I've never seen Sebastian get so passionate about something.#$b#This frog project has really brought out a spark in him.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Robin.Fri6": "Sebastian and Demetrius have been getting along much better since they started working together on helping the frogs.#$b#It makes me so happy.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Robin.Sat6": "The trees around the mountain have been looking much healthier lately.#$b#I wonder if Sebastian's conservation project has anything to do with it.",
	// Maru
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Maru.SebFrogHatch": "I'm thinking of building trackers to tag the frogs with, so Sebastian can monitor their behavior.#$b#What do you think?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Maru.summer_Tue8": "Sebastian and I have been growing a lot closer since he started working on his frog conservation project.#$b#He actually feels like my brother now.#$b#It's nice.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Maru.Fri8": "Seb and I have been tracking the frogs' behavioural patterns using tags I built.#$b#We're able to monitor things like food sources, nesting habits, and predator locations to see what areas need support.",
	// Alex
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Alex.SebFrogVideo": "Sebastian mentioned I sound like a sport announcer.#$b#I've never considered that before, but maybe that's something I could get into.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Alex.spring_Thu8": "Sebastian says frogs can jump twenty times their height!#$b#I wonder if I can train enough to jump that high?",
	// Haley
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Haley.SebFrogVideo": "It took forever to get the frog slime off my face.$2#$b#But at least I got some good photos of it first.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Haley.spring_Fri8": "I'm thinking of starting a social media account for the frog project.#$b#But I also don't want them to jump on me again when I'm taking pictures...$2#$b#I'll think about it.",
	// Shane
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Shane.SebFrogVideo": "I got some good footage the other day.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Shane.Mon8": "Getting good frog videos is pretty difficult.#$b#Their movements are unpredictable and they're always hopping between bright and shaded areas.#$b#Makes for a good challenge though.$1",
	// Linus
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Linus.SebFrogLake": "I've seen you folks working hard to set up frog habitats.#$b#I'm proud of what you're all doing for the valley.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Linus.Sun8": "I enjoy falling asleep to the sound of frogs croaking in the evening.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Linus.Thu8": "The mountain has gotten so lively since your friend started helping the frogs who live here.",
	// Kent
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Kent.spring_Thu8": "When I was a kid, we were always out late catching frogs.#$b#Now the kids out late helping them!#$b#Guess times have changed...$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Kent.fall_Thu8": "When I was a kid, we were always out late catching frogs.#$b#Now the kids out late helping them!#$b#Guess times have changed...$1",
	// Jodi
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Jodi.Fri": "Sam and his friends were out late checking on frog habitats last night.#$b#I wish he'd come home early, but I am glad he's doing something good for the environment and staying out of trouble, so I won't complain.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Jodi.fall_Thu8": "Vincent keeps coming home with muddy clothes.#$b#I know he's been helping with the frog project, but I wish there were cleaner ways for him to do that.$2#$b#Sam's started doing his own laundry, maybe I can ask him to start doing Vincent's as well...",
	// Vincent
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.SebFrogLake": "I had so much fun at the lake!#$b#My mom wasn't very happy with my dirty clothes when I got home though.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.SebFrogHatch": "Did you see all the little frogs?#$b#They looked so squishy!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.SebFrogSchool": "Ms. Penny said I did really good on my frog report.#$b#Mom was very happy about it!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.AcceptGiftFrogEgg": "Oh wow, a frog egg!#$b#I'm gonna ask Sebastian to show me how to hatch it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.winter_Wed": "All the frogs are asleep, so I can't see them right now.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.Wed": "I wanna watch the frogs, but Mom gets mad when I'm all dirty.$u#$b#It's a tough choice.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Vincent.summer_Fri": "I'm gonna go look at the frogs!",
	// Penny
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Penny.SebFrogHatch": "That was such an eductional activity!#$b#I'm glad I brought the children.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Penny.SebFrogSchool": "Vincent's report on frog life cycles was very well researched.#$b#I'm so happy to see him apply his passion to learning.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Penny.Wed6": "I'm trying to incorporate frogs into my lesson plans more to keep Vincent engaged.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Penny.summer_Sat6": "I'm planning another field trip to the lake for the kids to learn more about the ecosystem there.",
	// Jas
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Jas.SebFrogHatch": "Watching the frogs hatch was very cool!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Jas.SebFrogSchool": "I never realized that frogs are just like butterflies.#$b#Now I wanna learn more about them!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Jas.summer_Fri6": "Vincent keeps asking me to go visit the frogs with him.#$e#Do you think I should go?",
	// Mail //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M1.Body": "Hey @,^^About that frog egg you gave me yesterday - can you bring me another if you find one? Thanks.^^-Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M1.Header": "Sebastian Wants Another Frog Egg",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M2.Body": "Hey @,^^I reached out to the Ferngill Animal Conservation Center, and they sent me a kit to start a Gourmand Frog conservation project here in the valley. Stop by my room at around 2pm if you'd like to help.^^-Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M2.Header": "Sebastian's Conservation Project",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M3.Body": "Hey @,^^We've got all the materials we need. Let's meet up by the lake at around 3pm.^^-Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M3.Header": "Setting Up Habitats",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M4.Body": "Hey @,^^The eggs look like they're almost ready to hatch. I'm going to take them to their new homes by the lake soon, in case you want to watch.^^-Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M4.Header": "Hatching Frogs",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M5.Body": "Hey thanks again for coming @. I didn't realize so many people would be interested in frogs, it was kind of cool to see everyone gathered at the lake waiting for them to hatch. They seem to be doing well. Feel free to stop by the habitats any time to check on them, just be careful not to disturb them.^^-Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M5.Header": "Frog Update",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M6.Body": "Hey @,^^The frog population around the lake is stabilizing thanks to your help. I want to make sure it stays steady without overwhelming the natural resources, so if you'd like to have some of them, visit my mom while she's working. She'll occasionally have some that she can sell to you. That way I can put the money to good use for preservation efforts. I know you'll give them a good home. Thanks again for all your help @.^^-Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.M6.Header": "Frog Eggs At Robin's",
	// Quests //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q1.title": "Frog Eggs",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q1.text": "Sebastian is looking for rare Gourmand Frog eggs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q1.objective": "Deliver a Frog Egg to Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q1.reaction": "Hmm, let's see...#$b#Looks like this is also a Gourmand Frog egg!$1#$b#Nice work @!$7#$b#I'm going to put it in the quick tank I set up for the other one to make sure they stay safe while I look into a few things.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q2.title": "Frog Habitat Materials",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q2.text": "Sebastian needs a lot of moss to set up habitats for the Gourmand Frogs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q2.objective": "Deliver 500 Moss to Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q2.reaction": "Perfect!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q3.title": "Frog Habitat Materials",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q3.text": "Sebastian needs a lot of fiber to set up habitats for the Gourmand Frogs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q3.objective": "Deliver 500 Fiber to Sebastian",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Q3.reaction": "Perfect!",
	// Map Strings //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.1": "There's a cluster of frog eggs here. It looks like they're almost ready to hatch.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.2": "A couple of frogs are playing in the grass.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.3": "The frogs are enjoying the warm sunshine.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.4": "A frog is eyeing some bugs, waiting for its chance to catch one.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.5": "A couple of frogs are hopping around.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.6": "Some frogs are basking in the sun.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.7": "A few frogs are rolling hazelnuts around.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.8": "A frog pokes its head out of a leaf pile.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.9": "A frog is blinks lazily at you.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.10": "The frogs are hibernating.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.11": "The frogs are asleep for the winter.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.12": "It's too cold for the frogs to be awake right now.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.13": "The frogs are enjoying the rain.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.14": "There's a frog here that's croaking very loudly.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.15": "A couple of frogs are splashing around in a puddle.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.16": "The frogs are thriving.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.17": "A couple of frogs are napping in the grass.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.18": "A few frogs are resting on lilypads.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.MapString.19": "A frog is croaking in the shade.",
	// Events //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Event 1
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.0": "Alright, does anyone have questions before we get started?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.1": "Do you have any questions?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.2": "Nope.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.3": "Why is Vincent here?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.4": "What are we doing here again?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.5": "Good, let's get started.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.6": "Sam's letting me borrow him.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.7": "My big brother said I can touch as many frogs as I want as long as I don't tell Mom!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.8": "We are starting a conservation project for the endangered Gourmand Frog species.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.9": "As a conservation project, our objectives are to enhance the survival prospects of the Gourmand Frog population with respect to the local environment, study and monitor local Gourmand Frog behavioral patterns, and spread awareness about Gourmand Frogs and the dangers they face.#$b#Our first step will be to set up habitats around the nearby lake where they can gather and thrive.#$b#To do that we'll need natural materials.#$b#I can get wood and stone from my mom.#$b#That leaves things like moss, fiber, and bug meat.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.10": "I can get bug meat!#$b#It's the squishy pink stuff right?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.11": "Yeah, that would be good.#$b#@, what would you like to gather? Remember, we'll need a lot of it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.12": "Which material would you like to contribute?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.13": "Moss.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.14": "Fiber.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.15": "Great, I'll get the fiber.#$b#Bring it to me once you've gathered it all.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.16": "Great, I'll get the moss.#$b#Bring it to me once you've gathered it all.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E1.17": "It'll be a long road, but with our help, the Gourmand Frog population will grow to levels not seen since people started living in the valley.#$b#Let's get to it!$7",
	// Event 2
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.0": "Everyone have their materials?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.1": "Yup! Look!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.2": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.3": "I'm ready too.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.4": "Where do you think he gets that stuff?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.5": "Alright, let's get started.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.6": "I don't ask.$5#$b#Anyway, let's get started.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.7": "We'll split up to set up several habitat areas.#$b#Try to find wet, shaded places with good plant coverage close to the water.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.8": "Good work today.#$b#I've marked the locations of the habitats on a map so I can check them regularly.#$b#The eggs I got from @ are still incubating, so we'll let those areas settle for a bit till they're ready to hatch.#$b#That usually happens sometime around the start of spring.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.9": "Does that mean there's gonna be lots of frogs around here?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.10": "Yeah, this place will be full of them.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E2.11": "Cool! I can't wait to tell Miss Penny!",
	// Event 4
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.0": "You're here!$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.1": "A lot more people showed up than I was expecting...$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.2": "Well how could we not?#$b#You've been talking about it at the dinner table every day for ages.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.3": "Vincent's been very excited about the topic, so I thought this would be a good class learning opportunity.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.4": "And of course me and Abby showed up!$1#$b#We wouldn't miss this for the world.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.5": "Thank you all...#$b#It means a lot to me.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.6": "Alright, let me get these eggs in position.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.7": "Look!#$b#They've started hatching!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E4.8": "I wanna see!",
	// Event 6
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.0": "Perfect timing @.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.1": "We're shooting a video for a frog conservation website I'm making.#$b#Shane's handling the camera, and Alex agreed to narrate it.#$b#Between you and me, he sounds a bit too much like a sports announcer, but I'll take it.$2#$b#I also got Haley to snap a few photos for the site.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.2": "Just don't make me touch any of them!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.3": "Anyway, want to join us?#$b#The video could use an interview with a local resident.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.4": "Hey look, a frog just hopped out of the water.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.5": "Great, let's get some footage.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.6": "Ah!$9#$b#It's on my face!$9",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E6.7": "Get it off! Get it off!",
	// Event 7
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.0": "Hi @. I didn't hear you come over.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.1": "It's this frog.#$b#It's acting lethargic, and its skin doesn't look good.$2#$b#I think it's sick, but I'm not sure what to do about it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.2": "What should we do?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.3": "Does your conservation project kit have a guide for this?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.4": "Why don't you ask Demetrius?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.5": "I checked, I can't find matching symptoms in there.#$b#...$2#$b#I guess I could ask Demetrius...$5",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.6": "I guess I could do that...$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.7": "It's just kind of...#$b#Awkward, you know?$2#$b#We don't really talk much.#$b#He's not a bad guy or anything.#$b#We just don't have much in common.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.8": "#You're both interested in natural aspects of the Valley, that's something in common.#Are you really not going to help a sick frog because you don't want to talk to him?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.9": "I guess you're right.$2#$b#Come on, he's probably in his lab right now.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.10": "Hey, uh, Demetrius?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.11": "Hello Sebastian.#$b#And to you, @! How are you doing?$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.12": "What do you need today?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.13": "I was wondering if you could check on this frog.$2#$b#It seems sick, and I'm not sure how to help it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.14": "Bring it over here and I'll have a look.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.15": "Hmm...$5#$b#These look like symptoms of chytridiomycosis.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.16": "That doesn't sound good.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.17": "It's not.$2#$b#It's a type of fungal infection.$2#$b#But don't worry, it's treatable with an anti-fungal solution.$5#$b#I can make some for you.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.18": "What could have caused it?#$b#I'm worried about the other frogs in the lake.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.19": "Likely a pH instability.$5#$b#Fungal growth can occur in damp soil at certain pH levels.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.20": "pH?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.21": "It's a way of measuring how acidic a substance is.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.22": "Is there a way to change it?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.23": "Yes!#$b#That's actually been one of my projects here in the Valley.$1#$b#Let's start preparing the anti-fungal medication for this one and then go collect some soil samples.#$b#I can show you how to test the pH levels here in the lab.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.24": "...Okay.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E7.25": "It looks like Sebastian and Demetrius have a plan. I should leave them to it.",
	// Event 8
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.0": "And that's my presentation on the butterfly life cycle!$4",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.1": "Very good Jas!#$b#Your drawings had a lot of detail in them.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.2": "Now it's your turn Vincent.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.3": "I did my project on frogs!#$b#I like frogs because they're slimy and they make funny noises.#$b#They come from eggs that look like jelly eyeballs.#$b#When they hatch they don't have hands and feet.#$b#That's when they're called tad-poles.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.4": "Do you have a question, Jas?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.5": "Baby frogs don't have hands or feet?$3",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.6": "Nope!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.7": "That's so sad!$2#$b#How do they move?$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.8": "They have tails, and they move like fish!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.9": "Oh, okay!#$b#That's better then.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.10": "And when they grow up, they get hands and feet!#$b#That way they can jump really high.#$b#And their tail goes away too.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.11": "Wow, they change like butterflies do!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.12": "Excellent work Vincent.#$b#I can see you put a lot of effort into your presentation.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.13": "Sebastian lets me visit the frogs at the lake a lot!#$b#But they're all asleep right now.$3#$b#He said they'll wake up again in spring.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.14": "Like butterfly cocoons?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.15": "I don't know.$3",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.16": "Good observation Jas!#$b#It may seem similar, but it's actually a different process called 'hibernation'.#$b#We'll learn about that during our next lesson.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.17": "Okay Ms. Penny!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E8.18": "Yay! More frog lessons!",
	// Event 9 Married
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E9.0": "Hey @, enjoying the island?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E9.1": "I'm expanding my frog conservation project to this island.$1#$b#Gourmand frogs were once native here too, and I want to bring them back.#$b#I've been scouting out areas for habitats.#$b#You own some property here, right?#$b#Do you mind if I look around there too?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E9.2": "Thanks @. I appreciate it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E9.3": "You know, there are old tales about Gourmand frogs living for hundreds of years and growing as big as humans.#$b#It's never been proven though.$1#$b#I doubt they'll ever get that big, but I hope I can at least grow their population so they're not in danger anymore.$7",
	// Event 9 Unmarried
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E9.0": "Hey @, enjoying the island?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E9.1": "I'm expanding my frog conservation project to this island.$1#$b#Gourmand frogs were once native here too, and I want to bring them back.#$b#I've been scouting out areas for habitats.#$b#You own some property here, right?#$b#Do you mind if I look around there too?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E9.2": "Thanks @. I appreciate it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E9.3": "You know, there are old tales about Gourmand frogs living for hundreds of years and growing as big as humans.#$b#It's never been proven though.$1#$b#I doubt they'll ever get that big, but I hope I can at least grow their population so they're not in danger anymore.$7",
	// Event 10
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.0": "How are you doing, bub?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.1": "Still growing the good food?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.2": "Good, good.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.3": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.4": "I see more of my kind lately.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.5": "It's been a long time since we all roamed these jungles.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.6": "I was worried I would be the last one.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.7": "How do you respond?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.8": "There's a human who's been trying to help frogs thrive here.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.9": "Do you want to meet the person responsible for it?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.10": "Interesting...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.11": "Bring them to me.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.12": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.13": "Hmm...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.14": "I do.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.15": "Bring them to me.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.16": "Hmm...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.17": "There is a reason.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.18": "...But I do not know it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.19": "Give me one more favor, farmer.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.20": "Find the reason and bring it to me.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E10.21": "If danger approaches, I must know.",
	// Event 11 Married
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.0": "Hey @. Want to join me?#$b#I think I've found a pretty good habitat spot.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.1": "What's up?$5",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.2": "So... You are the one restoring my kind.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.3": "You have filled the lakes and jungles with the lively croaks of the young.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.4": "Tell me, what is the purpose for your actions?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.5": "Uh oh, Sebastian might be frozen in shock...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.6": "Wha-oh!$3#$b#Uh, right.$3#$b#Um...$3",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.7": "...Sorry, just processing.$3",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.8": "I mean, frogs are pretty cool.#$b#They've been around for hundreds of millions of years, and many can jump over twenty times their height.#$b#When @ showed me the Gourmand frog eggs they found, I realized the frogs still had a small presence in the Valley, but no one else knew enough to do anything about it.#$b#So I decided to.#$b#And I found out a lot of people actually get really interested when you present things like this in a cool way.#$b#So I've been getting a lot more help back home, and since access to the island opened up, I figured I could spread it here too.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.9": "Uh, if that's alright.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.10": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.11": "...You spread eggs throughout the lands?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.12": "You blanket the riverbanks in wood and moss and fiber?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.13": "You enter my cave and ask for permission to continue?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.14": "...yes?$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.15": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.16": "You have it!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.17": "It is good to hear the croaking of my kin throughout the island once more.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.18": "You and your actions are welcomed here.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.19": "I... I'm...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E11.20": "Thank you.$7#$b#I will.$1",
	// Event 11 Unmarried
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.0": "Hey @. Want to join me?#$b#I think I've found a pretty good habitat spot.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.1": "What's up?$5",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.2": "So... You are the one restoring my kind.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.3": "You have filled the lakes and jungles with the lively croaks of the young.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.4": "Tell me, what is the purpose for your actions?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.5": "Uh oh, Sebastian might be frozen in shock...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.6": "Wha-oh!$3#$b#Uh, right.$3#$b#Um...$3",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.7": "...Sorry, just processing.$3",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.8": "I mean, frogs are pretty cool.#$b#They've been around for hundreds of millions of years, and many can jump over twenty times their height.#$b#When @ showed me the Gourmand frog eggs they found, I realized the frogs still had a small presence in the Valley, but no one else knew enough to do anything about it.#$b#So I decided to.#$b#And I found out a lot of people actually get really interested when you present things like this in a cool way.#$b#So I've been getting a lot more help back home, and since access to the island opened up, I figured I could spread it here too.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.9": "Uh, if that's alright.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.10": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.11": "...You spread eggs throughout the lands?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.12": "You blanket the riverbanks in wood and moss and fiber?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.13": "You enter my cave and ask for permission to continue?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.14": "...yes?$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.15": "...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.16": "You have it!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.17": "It is good to hear the croaking of my kin throughout the island once more.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.18": "You and your actions are welcomed here.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.19": "I... I'm...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E11.20": "Thank you.$7#$b#I will.$1",
	// Event 12
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E12.0": "Hey @.#$b#Just a second.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E12.1": "Thanks for waiting.#$b#I'm working on the frog conservation website.#$b#It's been getting a lot of hits, even from outside the Valley.$7#$b#People everywhere want to help by donating or starting their own projects.$1#$b#Haley's even trying to get me to start a social media account for it.#$b#I think I'll leave that part to her though.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E12.2": "You know... I used to really want to move to the city.#$b#I wanted to be a cool programmer, known for making popular video games and stuff like that.$2#$b#But ever since I started this project, I've been feeling closer to the Valley.#$b#And the people in it.$2#$b#So I've decided to stay.$7#$b#Sam and Abigail have been learning about frogs so they can help me with the habitats, and Sam's mom makes us snacks to take with us.#$b#Vincent stops by a lot too. Penny says he's been doing really well in school because of the project.$1#$b#Shane's helping me set up wildlife cameras, and Maru built these really tiny trackers that we can use to track the frogs to find out more about them.$7#$b#My mom keeps giving me tips on stuff like wood and moss.#$b#And Demetrius is really excited to continue taking soil samples to 'maintain a balanced pH for optimal growth conditions'.$7#$b#I'm still figuring out what that means exactly, but I have to admit, working with him can be kind of cool sometimes.$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.E12.3": "What I'm trying to say is, thanks @.$7#$b#Thanks for helping me with this.$7#$b#I'll never forget it.$1",
	// Event 14 Married
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E14.0": "I'm so happy about what we've built here.#$b#The frogs are thriving and healthy.#$b#More frog conservation programs are popping up in other places, taking inspiration from us.#$b#I never imagined things could get to this point.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E14.1": "Thank you @.$7#$b#You're the best partner anyone could ask for.$7#$b#And I hope I can make you as happy as you've made me.$4",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E14.2": "@! Do you hear that?$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Married.E14.3": "It's like they're singing to us!$1",
	// Event 14 Unmarried
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E14.0": "I'm so happy about what we've built here.#$b#The frogs are thriving and healthy.#$b#More frog conservation programs are popping up in other places, taking inspiration from us.#$b#I never imagined things could get to this point.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E14.1": "Thank you @.$7#$b#You're the best friend anyone could ask for.$7#$b#And I hope everything we've accomplished together makes you as happy as it makes me.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E14.2": "@! Do you hear that?$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.Events.Unmarried.E14.3": "It's like they're singing to us!$1",
	// SVE Compat Events //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Event 4
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.0": "You're here!$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.1": "A lot more people showed up than I was expecting...$2",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.2": "Well how could we not?#$b#You've been talking about it at the dinner table every day for ages.$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.3": "Vincent's been very excited about the topic, so I thought this would be a good class learning opportunity.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.4": "And of course me and Abby showed up!$1#$b#We wouldn't miss this for the world.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.5": "Thank you all...#$b#It means a lot to me.$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.6": "Alright, let me get these eggs in position.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.7": "Look!#$b#They've started hatching!$1",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E4.8": "I wanna see!",
	// Event 6
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.0": "Perfect timing @.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.1": "We're shooting a video for a frog conservation website I'm making.#$b#Shane's handling the camera, and Alex agreed to narrate it.#$b#Between you and me, he sounds a bit too much like a sports announcer, but I'll take it.$2#$b#I also got Haley to snap a few photos for the site.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.2": "Just don't make me touch any of them!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.3": "Anyway, want to join us?#$b#The video could use an interview with a local resident.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.4": "Hey look, a frog just hopped out of the water.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.5": "Great, let's get some footage.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.6": "Ah!$9#$b#It's on my face!$9",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SVE.E6.7": "Get it off! Get it off!",
	// Change Events //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// 14H Event 1
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.0": "Hey @... Glad you showed up.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.1": "There's an injured frog in that bush... I gotta save him!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.2": "I need your help. Go over to the bush and try to get him to come towards me. I'll wait over here and catch him.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.3": "Okay... you ready?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.4": "Now!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.5": "Got him!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.6": "Poor little guy... his foot's all mangled. $s",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.7": "What should we do with him?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.8": "It's our new son...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.9": "I don't think he's going to make it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.10": "Let's nurse him back to health!",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.11": "I'm gonna take him home for now, and make him comfortable.#$b#I think the conservation kit has a guide on treating frog injuries.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.12": "Hah... Yeah, I guess so.$h#$b#He's definitely got your nose...$7",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.13": "Well, sorry if I don't take your word for it... I'm gonna give the poor guy a chance.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.14": "We'll do our best. But don't get too attached just yet...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E1.15": "Let's take him home.",
	// 14H Event 2
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.0": "Our little friend's doing much better, see?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.1": "...but I don't think he can go back into the wild... he's not fast enough to avoid predators anymore.#$b#...So I set up this terrarium.#$b#He looks happy, doesn't he?$h",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.2": "I wonder if he'll get lonely, though...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.3": "Maybe you can add a sanctuary to your conservation project for injured frogs?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.4": "He'll be fine.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.5": "...a haven specifically for frogs and toads who can't make it on their own? Not a bad idea.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.6": "He does look pretty tough. But still, If I find another injured frog, I think he'd be better off with a friend.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.7": "Why do you like frogs so much, anyway?",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.8": "I don't really want this in the house",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.9": "I'm glad you'll have some company while you work",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.10": "Hmm... Well, I like going out in the rain. So I guess I encountered a lot of frogs that way.#$b#I ended up feeling a common bond with the little guys.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.11": "Well it's not up for debate. This is my corner of the house and I can do what I want with it.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.12": "Yeah, it'll be fun. We can hang out while I work on my computer.#$b#I might even post about it online!$h",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.13": "Today our family grew a little larger...",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.ChangeEvents.14E2.14": "...and a lot slimier!",
	// BC Books //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SFSGuideBook.Title": "Gourmand Frog Conservation Guide",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SFSGuideBook.Descrip": "A handbook for frog conservation projects.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SFSGuideBook.Content": "^^Healthy adult frogs should have a mix of live insects in their diet, including crickets, earthworms, caterpillars, and dragonflies.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SFSSoilBook.Title": "Optimal Soil Conditions for the Anura Gourmand Frog Subspecies",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SFSSoilBook.Descrip": "A research paper on gourmand frogs.",
	"Si.SebFrogSanctuary.SFSSoilBook.Content": "^^A pH range that is neutral to slightly acidic will promote healthy growth and a welcoming reproductive atmosphere for anura gourmand frogs during the mating season.",
}